aptop in UAE. Perfect for students who want to game on a budget.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/726dfd7780fc25a5cfedd007ca4389fa795f43b4-1500x1395.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"HP\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":2487,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/4kdXeF0\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"reviewCount\":185,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Lenovo Yoga 7i 2-in-1 (Intel Core Ultra 7)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/lenovo-yoga-7i-2-in-1-laptop\",\"description\":\"The most versatile laptop on this list. Ideal for artists, students, and anyone who wants a tablet and laptop in one.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/6a0a5a4bfdfa421f1a78fe4aa58083a8584a629e-1500x897.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Lenovo\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":2788.75,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/45JsHcq\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"reviewCount\":24,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Apple MacBook Air 13-inch (M2 Chip, 2022)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/apple-macbook-air-m2-2022\",\"description\":\"The smartest buy for general users. You get premium Apple quality at a mid-range price point.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/1740e1275a42e5565546b1148b47f772b73de538-1500x909.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Apple\"},\"offers