":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"4. Essential Maintenance Tips for UAE Users\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"ab241621a56f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"ee3dbf83be79\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The UAE's unique climate (high heat and dust) can shorten your laptop's lifespan. Follow these tips to keep your machine running like new:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9a2359ac9422\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"25400b90999f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Fight the Dust:\"},{\"_key\":\"ab59cdf43436\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" The UAE is dusty. Use compressed air (canned air) once a month to blow dust out of your laptop’s vents and keyboard. This prevents overheating and sticking keys.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"26ee43b32e68\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"04f8b2cdf03b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Avoid the \\\"Hot Car\\\" Trap:\"},{\"_key\":\"f6c1adcb4b86\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Never leave your laptop in a parked car in Dubai or Abu Dhabi, even for 10 minutes. Extreme heat can permanently damage the battery and warp the screen layers.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9b14db6e9383\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1840e03535cb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Battery Health:\"},{\"_key\":\"7170fe331a5f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Don't leave your laptop plugged in at 100% 24/7. Most modern laptops (like ASUS and Lenovo) have a \\\"Battery Care\\\" mode in their settings—enable this to cap charging at 80% if you mostly use it at a desk.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"86a266547bac\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c20407fc5da3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Screen Care:\"},{\"_key\":\"f7b0f60ee778\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Use a \"},{\"_key\":\"9b41e19203b5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"d1041ff9200f\"],\"text\":\"Microfiber cloth \"},{\"_key\":\"270277b28a5b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"(not paper towels) to clean the screen. Avoid spraying water directly on the display; spray the cloth instead.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"d1041ff9200f\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://amzn.to/4r5eCPa\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"_key\":\"c49a95fc485a\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"d1b83684ce35\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"90ea5fc23af2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The MacBook Air M4 is the best premium choice. For budgets under AED 3000, the HP Victus 15 or Lenovo Yoga 7i are excellent alternatives.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Which is the best laptop for students in UAE 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"a50c78661ffb\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"35a8aa2d16f6\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9f23982fd457\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"code\"],\"text\":\"New laptops under 1000 AED often sacrifice speed. We recommend buying a refurbished Lenovo ThinkPad or checking deal sections for older Chromebook models.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Where can I find the best laptop under 1000 AED?\"},{\"_key\":\"a0bcbb368d21\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"fd9a70924785\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e1a1798dbbc4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The ASUS ROG Strix G16 (2025) is currently the top performer for thermal management and raw FPS power.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the best gaming laptop in UAE right now?\"}],\"intro\":\"Finding the best laptop in UAE for 2026 is exciting with the arrival of Apple M4 chips and AI-powered processors. Whether you need a student laptop under 1500 AED, a high-end gaming rig, or a professional ultrabook, we’ve ranked the top 10 models available on Amazon.ae right now.\",\"listItems\":[{\"_key\":\"8f4e7cefdc3d\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Overall Choice\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4qml56Z\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Apple\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Limited ports (2x Thunderbolt)\",\"Not suitable for heavy 3D gaming\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.6,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"M4 Chip\",\"18-Hour Battery\",\"Incredible build quality\",\"Silent fanless design\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Apple 2025 MacBook Air (13-inch, Apple M4 chip Laptop\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/831f52ce803ed1f1585fcd3d186c143ed8d2765b-1500x911.jpg\"},\"price\":3579,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Blazing fast AI performance\",\"Incredible build quality\",\"Silent fanless design\"],\"rating\":4.6,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":234,\"slug\":\"apple-macbook-air-m4-13-inch\",\"specifications\":[{\"specLabel\":\"Processor\",\"specValue\":\"Apple M4 Chip (10-core CPU)\"},{\"specLabel\":\"RAM\",\"specValue\":\"16GB Unified Memory\"},{\"specLabel\":\"Storage\",\"specValue\":\"256GB SSD\"},{\"specLabel\":\"Display\",\"specValue\":\"13.6-inch Liquid Retina (2560 x 1664)\"},{\"specLabel\":\"Graphics\",\"specValue\":\"10-core GPU / 16-core Neural Engine\"},{\"specLabel\":\"Battery Life\",\"specValue\":\"Up to 18 hours\"},{\"specLabel\":\"Operating System\",\"specValue\":\"macOS Sequoia\"},{\"specLabel\":\"Weight\",\"specValue\":\"1.24 kg\"},{\"specLabel\":\"Camera\",\"specValue\":\"12MP Center Stage Camera\"}],\"title\":\"Apple MacBook Air 13-inch (M4 Chip, 2025)\",\"verdict\":\"The undisputed king of portability. Best for students and profe